5,1,1,talk,Shion,,The noise from that room is unbearable. I need to know what is actually happening in there.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the costs. We need to see the numbers before deciding anything.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,It feels chaotic. Who is actually using it? I want to know the real usage patterns.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,We are working so close yet feeling distant. I wonder if this room can help us connect.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I suspect the current setup wastes everyone's time. I need to track where the hours go.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, if the cost is high, maybe we should just stop using it for food?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree. I will look into the invoices to see what we are paying.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, do you think a quiet space would help us talk more?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, perhaps. But we need a place where difficult conversations can happen without an audience.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the invoices might show if we are overpaying for space we do not use.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I will check the partition wall. If sound leaks, we need to know how bad it is.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the quotes for the fit-outs. I need to compare the two options.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the tally of use. I want to see who is actually in there.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at where the last awkward conversation happened. I want to understand the social cost.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the facilities callouts. I want to see how much maintenance this room requires.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
