35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The wall is thin. I can hear everything. And the crumbs are everywhere.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The invoices show we paid 68,000 yen last year. The fit-out quotes are 141,000 and 96,000.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The tally shows two people used it eleven times. The fridge clear-out was a mess.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The last awkward talk happened in front of everyone. Since the refit, we barely talk.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Eleven callouts last year. The lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. It is inefficient.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, 141,000 for a screen? That seems steep for just a table and cable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, yes, but the kitchen option is 96,000. Still, the invoices show we are already paying out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, if we barely talk, maybe a quiet room is better? But who cleans it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, a quiet room might isolate us further. We need a reason to interact.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the callouts suggest the kitchen will need more maintenance. The screen is simpler.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"I hate the noise. A quiet room would solve that, but I worry about the social aspect.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I prefer the meeting space. It is cheaper to maintain than a kitchen, and the invoices back that up.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,I like the idea of a meeting space. It gives us a reason to be there together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,I agree. A meeting space encourages the unplanned talk we are missing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The meeting space minimizes the hours lost to upkeep. It is the most efficient use of time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
